<title>FRANCE: Technip H1 net attrib up, sees year rise.</title>
<headline>Technip H1 net attrib up, sees year rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996.</p>
<p>	 (Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			    247.6   vs  212.5</p>
<p>    Net earnings per share		    14.87   vs  not given</p>
<p>    Turnover					4,803   vs  4,513</p>
<p>NOTE - The group said in a results statement &quot;the current level of activity is likely to lead to good growth in the year's results&quot;.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
